  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 907.01 Confidentiality. Phase II programs shall comply with RSA 172:8-a, RSA 318-B:12, 42 CFR 401.105, and 42 CFR 2, relative to confidentiality of client records and interactions, and shall comply with any other applicable laws.\n\nSource. #7058, eff 7-21-99; ss by #8902, INTERIM, eff 7-13-07, EXPIRED: 1-9-08\n\nNew. #9082, eff 1-30-08",
